WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.680
Start a stopwatch the moment you are born,

2
00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:05.080
and watch the seconds pile up.

3
00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:08.470
A thousand seconds passes
in well under an hour.

4
00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:12.530
A million seconds takes
about eleven point six days.

5
00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:15.480
But a billion is a thousand million.

6
00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:18.140
So how old are you when
the counter reaches it?

7
00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:19.780
Have you got there yet?

8
00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:23.860
In this mission, you'll write
huge numbers in standard form.

9
00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:27.270
One billion is one times ten to the nine.

10
00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:31.320
You'll multiply and divide numbers in
standard form without writing out all the

11
00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:32.450
zeros.

12
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.740
To divide, you divide the
numbers and subtract the powers.

13
00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:40.830
Your mission: work out whether
you are a billion seconds old yet.
